WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.209
Start a new empty notebook. (3× speed)

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:00.461
Upload the workshop book as the source. (3× speed)

00:00:00.461 --> 00:00:00.933
The workshop book is being indexed. (3× speed)

00:00:00.933 --> 00:00:01.295
Widen the mind-map request. (3× speed)

00:00:01.295 --> 00:00:03.516
Write the source-grounded request. (3× speed)

00:00:03.516 --> 00:00:05.625
Read the complete request.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:05.899
Send the question with the selected book. (3× speed)

00:00:05.899 --> 00:00:05.912
Generate the answer from the selected source. (4× speed)

00:00:05.912 --> 00:00:05.914
Expand the original interactive map.

00:00:05.914 --> 00:00:08.049
Create a native concept map from the book (3× speed)

00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:10.417
Read the complete map request

00:00:10.417 --> 00:00:10.652
Generate the native map

00:00:10.652 --> 00:00:10.792
Generate the configured native mind map. (4× speed)

00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:10.972
Verify the native result before review

00:00:10.972 --> 00:00:13.181
Open the generated model interventions mind map

00:00:13.181 --> 00:00:14.769
Open this generated map in a new tab

00:00:14.769 --> 00:00:17.042
Fit and read the original native mind map.

00:00:17.042 --> 00:00:19.947
Return to the four main branches

00:00:19.947 --> 00:00:23.235
Expand the complete generated mind map

00:00:23.235 --> 00:00:23.897
Explore training: optimisation updates model parameters.

00:00:23.897 --> 00:00:25.576
Collapse Ordinary Inference (§1.2) to focus training

00:00:25.576 --> 00:00:27.167
Collapse Context and Prompt Variations (§1.2 to focus training

00:00:27.167 --> 00:00:29.044
Collapse Retrieval-Augmented Generation RAG (§1.2 to focus training

00:00:29.044 --> 00:00:33.932
Zoom out to keep every map label in view

00:00:33.932 --> 00:00:41.318
Read how training changes model parameters.

00:00:41.318 --> 00:00:41.900
Open ordinary inference and keep its complete branch in view.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.499
Toggle Training and Fine-Tuning (§1.2)

00:00:43.499 --> 00:00:45.085
Toggle Ordinary Inference (§1.2)

00:00:45.085 --> 00:00:48.195
Zoom out to keep every map label in view

00:00:48.195 --> 00:00:55.033
Read ordinary inference with fixed model parameters.

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:55.702
Open context and prompt variations.

00:00:55.702 --> 00:00:57.468
Toggle Ordinary Inference (§1.2)

00:00:57.468 --> 00:00:59.023
Toggle Context and Prompt Variations (§1.2

00:00:59.023 --> 00:01:03.712
Zoom out to keep every map label in view

00:01:03.712 --> 00:01:10.433
Read how prompt definitions change context without updating weights.

00:01:10.433 --> 00:01:11.385
Open retrieval-augmented generation.

00:01:11.385 --> 00:01:12.994
Toggle Context and Prompt Variations (§1.2

00:01:12.994 --> 00:01:14.709
Toggle Retrieval-Augmented Generation RAG (§1.2

00:01:14.709 --> 00:01:19.479
Zoom out to keep every map label in view

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:26.516
Read how retrieved passages supply context to a fixed model.

00:01:26.516 --> 00:01:27.138
Return to the complete source-cited mind map.

00:01:27.138 --> 00:01:28.857
Return to the four main concepts

00:01:28.857 --> 00:01:31.381
Restore the complete source-cited map

00:01:31.381 --> 00:01:35.300
Review the complete mind map and its original source references.
